  "full_response": "Subject: Issue with Order #123456 - Urgent Resolution Needed\n\nDear Customer Support,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is [Full Name], and I recently placed an order with your company via the following details:\n\n- **Order Number:** 123456\n- **Email Address:** [CustomerEmail@Domain.com](mailto:CustomerEmail@Domain.com)\n- **Phone Number:** (555)555-5555\n- **Home Address:** [Customer Address Line 1], [City, State, Zip Code]\n- **Today's Date:** [Today's Date]\n\nI am writing to inform you about a troubling discrepancy regarding my recent order (Order #123456). Upon receiving the package, I discovered that several items were missing and some items were not as described on your website. This issue is not only inconvenient for me but also reflects dishonesty in your business practices.\n\nIn particular, I expected to receive the following items:\n- [List of expected items with quantities and descriptions]\n\nHowever, I found that the package included:\n- [List of received items, noting what was missing or incorrect]\n\nI have always appreciated your company's quality products and service, but I am left perplexed regarding this recent experience. Your prompt attention to this matter is highly anticipated.\n\nI kindly request the following:\n1. [Specify the resolution, such as a full refund, replacement order, or other solution you propose].\n2. A confirmation of when I can expect this issue to be resolved.\n\nI trust that you will give this matter urgent attention. Please contact me directly regarding how to proceed. I am available to discuss this further and provide any additional information if needed. My primary contact details are as follows:\n\n- **Phone Number:** (555) 555-5555\n- **Email:** [CustomerEmail@Domain.com](mailto:CustomerEmail@Domain.com)\n\nI look forward to your prompt resolution to this matter.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Full Name]",
